Orbit Post Office case exclusion

The original artwork, game scene/script/content, film, production recipes, data and
downloadable package in docs/showcase/orbit-post-office/ are excluded from the
MIT grant above. They retain their existing rights and separately scoped
upstream notices. See docs/showcase/orbit-post-office/LICENSES.md. This exclusion
does not change the scope of any other case's recorded rights.

Native Godot Web case exclusions

The original Sonic Loom and Prism Tide game/instrument code, their Web-specific
native adapters, visual design and synthesized audio in
scripts/godot_web/projects/sonic-loom/ and scripts/godot_web/projects/prism-tide/,
their exported play/sonic-loom/game.pck and play/prism-tide/game.pck packs,
and the corresponding Sonic Loom / Prism Tide screenshots in play/evidence/,
retain the existing rights reserved for those cases and are excluded from the
MIT grant above. Publication of a playable export makes no additional license
grant. See play/LICENSES.md and the original case notices. The shared Godot
runtime and its components retain their own upstream licenses and notices in
play/runtime/LICENSE.txt and play/runtime/COPYRIGHT.txt.

Brass Pendulum case exclusion

The original scene, rendered imagery, video, scene recipe, evidence and
case-specific documentation in docs/showcase/brass-pendulum-denoise/ are
excluded from the MIT grant above and retain their rights. Publication makes
no additional license grant. See that case's LICENSES.md. Shared website code
and all existing upstream licenses are unchanged.

Tidal Sanctuary case exclusion

The original Tidal Sanctuary gameplay code, procedural terrain and ruins,
character, shader, visual design and creative scene recipe in
scripts/godot_web/tidal-sanctuary/game/, the original Blender meshes, native
scene files, animation and case-specific asset recipes in
scripts/godot_web/tidal-sanctuary/artwork/, and this case's original creative
presentation imagery and video, retain their existing rights and are excluded
from the MIT grant above. Publication of a playable export makes no additional
license grant. See scripts/godot_web/tidal-sanctuary/LICENSES.md.

This exclusion does not apply to shared authoring, export, capture or CI tools,
including scripts/godot_web/tidal-sanctuary/ci/, which remain under MIT. The
Kenney, Poly Haven and KayKit upstream content retains CC0 1.0 Universal,
and the subset font retains the
SIL Open Font License; their upstream notices and rights are unchanged. This
exclusion does not change the scope of any other case's recorded rights.

Dawnkeep original game exclusion

The original gameplay, game scene/script/content, interface, visual design,
authored artwork, generated feedback sound, production recipes and resulting
media in scripts/godot_web/dawnkeep/ are excluded from the MIT grant above and
retain the rights recorded in scripts/godot_web/dawnkeep/LICENSES.md. Shared
acceptance/tooling adaptations retain their existing notices. Credited upstream
CC0 model/music assets, OFL font and Godot runtime keep their original licenses.
This exclusion does not change any other case's rights.

